From 451b601caab9accbdcbd2e72dce7e07177f026fa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gus bourg <gus@bourg.net>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 20:15:18 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 07/17] media: amlogic: amvdec: add stateful HEVC decoding

Add HEVC decoding on GX and G12 hardware, with reference management,
firmware parameter handling and compressed-frame storage. Bound parsed
dimensions by the negotiated format. Refuse single-column multi-row
pictures because the hardware does not produce reliable output for
that geometry. Preserve parked FBC bodies across allocation failure.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-fable-5-1
Assisted-by: Codex:gpt-5.6
Assisted-by: Codex:gpt-6.0
